/* The same elements again, for components that hand an element to the caller's
block instead of closing it themselves. These defer nothing: they write the
opening tag and record it, and h.close_all writes the close back in the
caller's scope. See component.odin -- a bare _open outside a component is an
error, not an open tag. */
a_open :: proc(attrs: ..Attr) { open_pending("a", attrs) }
abbr_open :: proc(attrs: ..Attr) { open_pending("abbr", attrs) }
